##### IN #####
^ab &cd %ef @gh !
##### EXP #####
[ab;tcd;tb;ef;zz;gh;b;]
##### IN #####
^ab &cd %ef @gh ;
##### EXP #####
[ab;tcd;tb;ef;zz;gh;b;]
##### IN #####
@ab %cd &ef ^gh !
##### EXP #####
[ab;b;cd;zz;ef;tb;gh;t]
##### IN #####
@ab %cd &ef ^gh ;
##### EXP #####
[ab;b;cd;zz;ef;tb;gh;t]
